WEBVTT

00:09.093 --> 00:11.053
I returned from the depths of hell

00:11.345 --> 00:14.807
to take you down.

00:17.476 --> 00:20.062
I'll have to send you back there, then.

00:24.108 --> 00:24.984
Shin!

00:25.401 --> 00:27.528
Your life ends here!

00:31.157 --> 00:32.324
Kenshiro!

02:23.018 --> 02:25.563
<i>In the year 199X,</i>

02:26.522 --> 02:29.900
<i>the world was engulfed in nuclear fire!!</i>

02:34.947 --> 02:37.616
<i>The seas dried up, the earth split open,</i>

02:38.576 --> 02:42.162
<i>and it seemed as if all life
had been wiped out...</i>

02:48.919 --> 02:49.795
<i>And yet...</i>

02:51.714 --> 02:54.508
<i>humanity somehow survived!!</i>

03:33.047 --> 03:34.672
Water!

03:34.673 --> 03:37.676
Lots of food too!

03:45.100 --> 03:48.062
Look what else they've got.

03:48.354 --> 03:52.316
Plenty of paper to wipe our asses with!

03:53.984 --> 03:58.739
<i>So begins a new era
where violence rules the world.</i>

04:01.825 --> 04:02.785
Zeed!

04:04.787 --> 04:08.415
Something happened to the recon squad!

04:08.958 --> 04:10.209
What?

04:18.759 --> 04:19.927
Damn...

04:21.428 --> 04:23.305
W... Who did this...?

04:24.014 --> 04:25.975
Who the hell did this?!

04:30.437 --> 04:34.525
They don't know who they're messing with!

04:34.650 --> 04:35.567
Zeed!

04:35.734 --> 04:36.860
Huh?

04:37.236 --> 04:38.612
Something's not right here.

04:39.113 --> 04:41.490
An external force wouldn't have done this.

04:41.865 --> 04:45.744
It's almost like they burst open
from the inside.

04:46.203 --> 04:48.205
This guy's still breathing!

04:49.415 --> 04:53.293
Hey! Tell me what happened here!

04:54.086 --> 04:56.880
The Great Dipper...

04:57.423 --> 04:58.674
The what?

05:04.722 --> 05:06.390
What just happened?

05:06.598 --> 05:09.643
Was that a time bomb?

05:10.227 --> 05:16.191
No. There's no way anything that complex
is still kicking around these days.

05:17.985 --> 05:19.695
<i>What the hell did he mean</i>

05:20.404 --> 05:21.947
<i>by "the Great Dipper"?</i>

05:27.119 --> 05:31.498
A CRY FROM THE HEART

05:58.484 --> 06:00.778
W... Water...

06:32.976 --> 06:36.188
Water...

06:41.735 --> 06:45.781
We'll keep him here
until the Elder gets back.

06:50.661 --> 06:53.622
Looks like another dumbass
stumbled his way in here.

06:54.498 --> 06:56.458
Rin. Bring him some water.

07:04.800 --> 07:07.511
Th... Thank you...

07:13.308 --> 07:15.102
Grab the keys!

07:16.728 --> 07:19.022
What are you waiting for?!

07:19.148 --> 07:22.734
You're just another thief
as far as they see it.

07:22.943 --> 07:25.487
We've gotta get outta here
before they kill us!

07:27.156 --> 07:28.240
Huh?

07:32.828 --> 07:36.081
You bastard!
What the hell did you do to me?!

07:39.543 --> 07:43.839
Sorry, but could I trouble you
for another cup of water?

07:45.382 --> 07:49.344
C'mon!
You didn't have to go that far, asshole!

07:49.595 --> 07:53.431
Ooh that smarts.
What the hell were you thinking?

07:53.432 --> 07:57.311
What do you think would happen to her
if she let you escape?

07:59.563 --> 08:02.524
You picked a fine time
to be a bleeding heart, buddy.

08:02.733 --> 08:05.152
I'm surprised you've made it this far.

08:05.736 --> 08:08.197
C'mon. Admit it.

08:08.322 --> 08:11.491
You're only here because you heard
the rumors about this village, right?

08:12.409 --> 08:14.286
Take a look outside!

08:14.578 --> 08:18.248
This place has water!
It's sitting on an aquifer.

08:18.373 --> 08:21.710
That means they've got tons of food too!

08:21.919 --> 08:25.422
If you wanna survive in this world,
you need food and water.

08:25.923 --> 08:29.384
The strong take what they want,
and live on.

08:30.636 --> 08:33.055
Violence reigns supreme.

08:34.514 --> 08:39.728
The chumps in this village may have
their own self-defense force,

08:39.937 --> 08:42.606
but at the end of the day,
they're a bunch of amateurs.

08:42.731 --> 08:45.692
The second they meet a real militia,
they're toast.

08:47.152 --> 08:48.070
Hey.

08:49.738 --> 08:52.366
Listen. You wanna team up?

08:56.245 --> 08:57.955
Hmph! Suit yourself.

09:04.628 --> 09:08.423
Hm? Hey, what the hell?

09:08.674 --> 09:11.009
You're bringing him food?

09:30.737 --> 09:33.115
Man, that village was a waste of time.

09:33.240 --> 09:36.159
They didn't have anything worth a damn.

09:36.368 --> 09:37.786
Damn, I'm hungry.

09:37.911 --> 09:39.413
We're gonna run out of fuel.

09:51.216 --> 09:54.845
We'd better hit the jackpot this time!

10:03.478 --> 10:06.189
Thank you. That hit the spot.

10:08.650 --> 10:11.361
Are you sure it was okay
to give me all of that?

10:13.071 --> 10:16.575
Now she's turning red.
Damn brat.

10:16.950 --> 10:18.869
What's your name?

10:19.536 --> 10:20.495
Call me "Ken."

10:22.122 --> 10:25.834
You're wasting your time.
She can hear you, but she can't speak.

10:26.668 --> 10:27.627
Can't speak?

10:27.753 --> 10:29.755
Can't blame her, though.

10:30.172 --> 10:33.592
Her whole family was murdered by bandits
right in front of her eyes.

10:34.009 --> 10:37.137
She's got no one left,
and the villagers treat her as a burden.

10:37.429 --> 10:39.514
Now they've got her playing prison guard.

10:39.973 --> 10:44.186
No one needs a useless brat around
in times like these.

10:44.644 --> 10:48.273
Honestly, she'd have been better off
if she was never born.

10:54.696 --> 10:56.822
I'm just sayin'!

10:56.823 --> 11:00.577
You don't gotta look at me like that.

11:03.038 --> 11:03.914
Does it hurt?

11:09.878 --> 11:10.754
I see...

11:12.672 --> 11:17.511
<i>I can't imagine the kinds of hell
that those innocent eyes have seen.</i>

11:22.724 --> 11:23.600
It's okay.

11:24.184 --> 11:25.018
Don't move.

11:30.816 --> 11:33.318
Whoa, what the hell was that?

11:33.443 --> 11:35.737
I cast a spell to help her speak again.

11:36.029 --> 11:37.781
You what?

11:38.323 --> 11:40.492
The rest is up to her.

11:41.159 --> 11:43.495
Her heart's cry will help her
find her voice.

11:43.995 --> 11:46.456
The hell are you on about?

11:47.999 --> 11:50.210
Well, even if you're lying,

11:50.335 --> 11:54.631
it's probably the first time in her life
anyone gave a damn about her.

12:00.011 --> 12:00.970
Get up!

12:00.971 --> 12:02.347
The Elder has returned!

12:06.143 --> 12:07.644
Where are you headed?

12:08.728 --> 12:09.938
Nowhere in particular.

12:10.063 --> 12:13.275
Elder. He could be one of Zeed's men.

12:13.859 --> 12:15.152
Search him.

12:15.735 --> 12:21.283
If he's one of them, he should have
Zeed's mark tattooed on him somewhere.

12:29.458 --> 12:32.210
Th... The Great Dipper...

12:32.669 --> 12:34.921
The stars that rule over death...

12:36.423 --> 12:39.843
Where the Great Dipper goes,
chaos follows...

12:41.595 --> 12:43.346
An ill omen...

12:53.106 --> 12:55.233
This is bad!

12:56.026 --> 12:57.235
Hey, wake up!

12:59.529 --> 13:00.780
They're coming!

13:01.156 --> 13:02.407
Tell the Elder!

13:02.532 --> 13:03.742
Right.

13:13.543 --> 13:14.461
Where are they?

13:15.212 --> 13:16.254
W... What?!

13:16.379 --> 13:17.714
Bad news!

13:17.839 --> 13:20.383
It's Zeed! Zeed's gang is here!

13:26.640 --> 13:27.599
Dammit.

13:45.033 --> 13:46.993
Rin! You're fighting too!

13:58.880 --> 14:02.217
Well, you've sure got her charmed.

14:02.384 --> 14:06.179
She even left you the keys
on the way to her death.

14:06.555 --> 14:07.430
Her death?!

14:07.722 --> 14:13.144
Yep. Zeed's gang doesn't spare anyone,
not even women and children.

14:14.062 --> 14:14.896
Huh?

14:17.399 --> 14:18.233
What are you...

14:30.829 --> 14:33.123
Hey, wait! I said wait!

14:41.756 --> 14:43.300
Where are you going?!

14:43.925 --> 14:48.387
These guys aren't gonna last
a single minute against Zeed!

14:48.388 --> 14:50.098
We gotta run while we can!

14:53.560 --> 14:54.644
Water!

14:54.978 --> 14:58.356
Bring me all of your food and water!

14:58.732 --> 15:03.193
Make it quick,
or I'll rip this brat's head off!

15:03.194 --> 15:04.946
Give us every last crumb!

15:05.071 --> 15:06.114
All your fuel, too!

15:06.406 --> 15:08.325
Elder! Don't worry about us.

15:08.450 --> 15:09.534
We'll stand and fight!

15:27.218 --> 15:29.262
Ken!!

15:30.555 --> 15:33.475
Stay away!!

15:34.351 --> 15:35.935
She talked...

15:36.478 --> 15:38.647
Why now...?

15:41.274 --> 15:43.360
<i>The rest is up to her.</i>

15:43.985 --> 15:46.321
<i>Her heart's cry will help her
find her voice.</i>

15:47.447 --> 15:51.034
Just who the hell are you?

15:51.409 --> 15:53.161
What did you do back there?

15:53.578 --> 15:55.080
Run away!

15:55.205 --> 15:58.041
- Shut your mouth, brat!
- Ken!

15:58.708 --> 16:00.210
Her heart's cry.

16:01.711 --> 16:03.046
Hey!

16:05.256 --> 16:06.925
Ken...

16:11.513 --> 16:13.682
The hell do you want?

16:14.099 --> 16:15.517
Back off!

16:17.352 --> 16:18.228
Move.

16:20.188 --> 16:21.898
Check out the balls on this guy!

16:22.023 --> 16:23.817
We're gonna shred ya!

16:30.949 --> 16:32.742
You wanna screw with us, bastard?!

16:41.084 --> 16:44.003
Hokuto Shinken...

16:45.797 --> 16:46.715
What?

16:47.257 --> 16:50.635
What are you waiting for? Kill him!

17:28.590 --> 17:29.591
He's mine!

17:34.387 --> 17:38.516
Whoa. Who even is this guy?

18:10.924 --> 18:12.550
Let her go.

18:13.134 --> 18:15.178
So it was you!

18:15.970 --> 18:18.598
You're the one who killed my men!

18:54.717 --> 18:57.011
Hokuto Hundred Blows Rushing Fist!

18:59.430 --> 19:01.099
<i>I've heard tell</i>

19:01.224 --> 19:05.478
<i>of a fearsome assassination art
that originated in China long ago.</i>

19:05.770 --> 19:09.107
<i>Its name was "Hokuto Shinken."</i>

19:09.524 --> 19:12.360
<i>Its users concentrate all of their energy
into one fist</i>

19:12.485 --> 19:15.405
<i>and strike the body's
Hidden Channeling Points.</i>

19:15.530 --> 19:20.451
<i>The resulting damage causes the body
to rupture from the inside out.</i>

19:20.577 --> 19:23.454
<i>A martial art that kills
with a single strike.</i>

19:23.913 --> 19:27.959
And now it appears before us...

19:29.043 --> 19:34.299
Your hits pack as much punch
as a mosquito bite!

19:37.677 --> 19:39.929
Hope you're ready to die!

19:40.597 --> 19:43.766
You are already dead.

19:43.975 --> 19:45.560
What was that?

20:04.829 --> 20:07.999
Zeed's men are retreating!

20:12.587 --> 20:13.880
Thank you.

20:15.882 --> 20:16.758
Ken!

20:28.978 --> 20:32.690
I see...
So you hit the pressure points and then...

20:34.233 --> 20:38.154
Why don't you just stay here though?

20:38.279 --> 20:40.990
If they had someone like you,
they'd be set for life.

20:41.115 --> 20:43.493
They've got lots of food, too.

20:44.160 --> 20:45.036
Huh?

20:45.453 --> 20:46.496
Oh well.

20:46.621 --> 20:49.582
As long as I stick with this guy,
I won't go hungry!

20:50.416 --> 20:52.794
Hey! Wait up!

20:52.919 --> 20:55.004
The name's Bat!

20:55.129 --> 20:58.049
Wait for me!

21:05.932 --> 21:08.601
Ken!

21:12.230 --> 21:13.272
Why...

21:15.400 --> 21:19.821
They say that where the Great Dipper goes,
chaos follows.

21:20.655 --> 21:26.077
He left to keep our village safe.

21:27.245 --> 21:29.831
To keep you safe, Rin.

21:30.873 --> 21:32.208
You understand, right?

21:36.421 --> 21:37.296
Ken...

23:37.917 --> 23:39.919
SUBTITLE TRANSLATION BY LEUCA HACHE
